[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5280.87, "timestamp": "01:28:00", "text": "それで、私のアイデアは、ああ、待って。必要ありません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5288.07, "timestamp": "01:28:08", "text": "え？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5292.39, "timestamp": "01:28:12", "text": "ええと、私のアイデアは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5295.43, "timestamp": "01:28:15", "text": "これらの農場、これらの食料農場を積み重ねられるようにすることです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5299.35, "timestamp": "01:28:19", "text": "それで、このベンチが必要だと思います、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5303.91, "timestamp": "01:28:23", "text": "リビングルームの家具セット。ええ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5305.75, "timestamp": "01:28:25", "text": "そうすれば、このような無駄なスペースは必要ありません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5307.669, "timestamp": "01:28:27", "text": "、そうですよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5309.51, "timestamp": "01:28:29", "text": "垂直に積み重ねます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5313.27, "timestamp": "01:28:33", "text": "ええ。水平ではなく垂直に。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5315.43, "timestamp": "01:28:35", "text": "ええと。え？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5322.79, "timestamp": "01:28:42", "text": "誰が 君？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5325.27, "timestamp": "01:28:45", "text": "交渉人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5337.75, "timestamp": "01:28:57", "text": "戦いたいのか？"}]